{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26244","headline":"寄许浑秀才 · 殷尧藩","name":"寄许浑秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万木惊秋叶渐稀，静探造化见玄机。\n眼前谁悟先天理，去後还知今日非。\n树拥秣陵千嶂合，云开萧寺一僧归。\n汉廷累下徵贤诏，未许严陵老钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}